{
  "tema": 9340,
  "slug": "hay-niebla-esta-nublado-llueve",
  "titulo": "Weather with hay, está or a weather verb",
  "subtitulo": "Hay niebla, está nublado, llueve.",
  "foto": "t04.jpg",
  "regla": "Talk about the weather with hay + noun (hay niebla), está + adjective or -ndo form (está nublado, está lloviendo), or a weather verb on its own (llueve, nieva). Weather verbs have no subject and only use the él form.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Spanish has three easy ways to describe the weather (besides **hace**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Pattern",
            "Use",
            "Examples"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "**hay** + noun",
              "there is fog, wind…",
              "hay niebla, hay viento, hay nubes, hay tormenta"
            ],
            [
              "**está** + adjective / -ndo",
              "what the sky is like now",
              "está nublado, está soleado, está lloviendo, está nevando"
            ],
            [
              "weather verb",
              "it rains, it snows…",
              "llueve, nieva, truena, graniza"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Weather verbs have **no subject**: just **llueve**, never _it_ + verb. They only use the **él** form."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Careful: **lluvia** is the noun (_rain_), **llueve** is the verb (_it rains_)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "En Tijuana ==hay== mucha niebla en las mañanas de junio.",
              "en": "In Tijuana it's very foggy on June mornings."
            },
            {
              "es": "Hoy ==está nublado==, pero no hace frío.",
              "en": "It's cloudy today, but it isn't cold."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Está lloviendo== y no traigo paraguas.",
              "en": "It's raining and I don't have an umbrella."
            },
            {
              "es": "En verano casi nunca ==llueve== en Tijuana.",
              "en": "It almost never rains in Tijuana in summer."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Nieva== en la sierra de Juárez? Sí, a veces.",
              "en": "Does it snow in the Sierra de Juárez? Yes, sometimes."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Hay== tormenta; mejor no surfeamos hoy.",
              "en": "There's a storm; we'd better not surf today."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
